# T_SCRR: the item listing's options form: the category and location
# pick lists, FILE output without a file name, then SCREEN output in the
# viewer: a page down, to its end, a page up, a line down and up, back
# to its start, and the help over it.
S LFORM
K F4
S CATPICK
K DOWN ENTER TAB F4
S LOCPICK
K ENTER
S PICKED
K CTRL-Y STAB CTRL-Y TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB SPACE SPACE CTRL-S
S NEEDFILE
K STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S VIEW1
K PGDN
S VIEW2
K END
S VIEWEND
K PGUP
S VPGUP
K DOWN
S VDOWN
K UP HOME F1
S VHELP
K ESC ESC
S BACK
K ESC
